flowchart TD
  Need[Email need] --> Inbound{Inbound?}
  Inbound -->|Yes| Routing[Cloudflare Email Routing]
  Routing --> Workflow{Needs processing?}
  Workflow -->|Yes| Worker[Email Worker to Queue / D1 / R2]
  Workflow -->|No| Forward[Forward to human inbox]
  Inbound -->|No| Outbound{Outbound type?}
  Outbound -->|Transactional| Transactional[Resend or Postmark]
  Outbound -->|Marketing| Marketing[Loops / Customer.io]
  Outbound -->|Agent draft| Approval[App policy and human approval]
  Approval --> Transactional
